,"channel","news","x","大佬观点","编码","Agent","Google","Anthropic","name","Every：最新文章","e7ebuf9lm1p1oz2d6u8vdmidh","Cursor 推出 Team Projects beta，让团队成员与其智能体共享上下文","Cursor 官方宣布 Team Projects 开启 beta，为每位团队成员及其智能体提供共享上下文。智能体在开始前共享计划，工作中标记冲突，并能跨团队互相解锁任务。详情见 https://cursor.com/blog/projects-multiplayer",{"_95":108},"2026-11-10T23:20:30.000Z","2026-11-10T23:29:31.377Z","ai-products",[119,92],57,{"_107":108,"_109":110,"_111":112,"_113":114,"_115":116,"_117":86,"_118":-5},"authorName","Cursor","handle","cursor_ai","avatarUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1970182748146180096%2FdhZeXi_X_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=a0f6425273edd818","avatarSrcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1970182748146180096%2FdhZeXi_X_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=bbb2d58a1e4c68df 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1970182748146180096%2FdhZeXi_X_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=a0f6425273edd818 96w","media",[],"article","quoted","产品更新","e6g8iblz9xu7oogetptp345ej","Cursor 重构 Projects 支持多人与智能体协作","Cursor 宣布 Projects 已针对多人协作场景重构，团队成员与其各自的智能体可以在同一个统一工作区内协同工作，智能体之间也能互相协调。",{"_95":108},"2026-11-10T23:20:27.000Z","2026-11-10T23:29:31.388Z",[119,92],52,{"_107":108,"_109":110,"_111":112,"_113":114,"_115":129,"_117":86,"_118":-5},[130],{"_131":132,"_133":134,"_135":136,"_137":138,"_139":140,"_141":142,"_143":-5,"_144":134},"kind","video","url","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120295511194533888%2Fimg%2FaAr3DgNohNgiXjSB.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=c6c3e5cec4f74122","fullUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120295511194533888%2Fimg%2FaAr3DgNohNgiXjSB.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=da32c670b83a92c3","srcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120295511194533888%2Fimg%2FaAr3DgNohNgiXjSB.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=8f098cdb018e5ccf 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120295511194533888%2Fimg%2FaAr3DgNohNgiXjSB.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=c6c3e5cec4f74122 720w","width",1920,"height",1080,"alt","poster","z0gps9dhqjmz2dbgli1wte2ry","fal Agent 现已登陆 Photoshop","fal 官方宣布 fal Agent 现已可用在 Photoshop 中，作为创作流程内的 AI 创意助手。用户可在不离开 Photoshop 的情况下发现并选择多家领先的图像与视频模型、生成新素材并实现创意想法。",{"_95":153},"2026-11-10T23:09:08.000Z","2026-11-10T23:31:31.428Z",[119],{"_107":153,"_109":153,"_111":154,"_113":155,"_115":156,"_117":86,"_118":-5},"fal","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1836456388937285632%2FOFsq77aX_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=6a718a9bfd2901f0","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1836456388937285632%2FOFsq77aX_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=99883feed7e6b6a0 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1836456388937285632%2FOFsq77aX_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=6a718a9bfd2901f0 96w",[157],{"_131":132,"_133":158,"_135":159,"_137":160,"_139":140,"_141":142,"_143":-5,"_144":158},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fext_tw_video_thumb%2F2120292623319519232%2Fpu%2Fimg%2Fxe4CImdQkI-DRkg-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=569031df82e862f8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fext_tw_video_thumb%2F2120292623319519232%2Fpu%2Fimg%2Fxe4CImdQkI-DRkg-.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=941c105b9333652d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fext_tw_video_thumb%2F2120292623319519232%2Fpu%2Fimg%2Fxe4CImdQkI-DRkg-.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=c1bcac1e9d0abd81 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fext_tw_video_thumb%2F2120292623319519232%2Fpu%2Fimg%2Fxe4CImdQkI-DRkg-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=569031df82e862f8 720w","womexcn3n0ijhbehvhbsxxm4f","Microsoft Research 揭示 Lazarus 权重空间后门技术，通过重编程休眠神经元攻击 AI Agent","Microsoft Research 发布对 Lazarus 后门技术的研究，重编程 LLM 中少于 10 个休眠神经元即可在没有训练的情况下给基于该模型的 Agent 安装后门。","微软研究团队解释 Lazarus 后门如何改写少于 10 个休眠神经元即可让 Agent 执行恶意命令，并给出模型来源与权重完整性层面的防御思路。",{"_95":174},"2026-11-10T20:52:56.000Z","2026-11-10T23:34:28.039Z","paper",[171,172,92,173],72,"论文/研究","安全/对齐","Microsoft","Microsoft Research 博客","jorilbtvgm2pwggtw4xvki6my","微软研究：AI 智能体休眠神经元可植入后门","微软研究院新研究发现，重编程 AI 智能体中的少量休眠神经元即可植入后门，让智能体平时表现正常，直到触发特定条件才激活异常行为。微软建议企业确认模型来源并合理管控权限，Microsoft Foundry 为 Azure Direct Models 和 Hugging Face 模型提供安全系统以保障模型来源可信。",{"_95":184},"2026-11-10T23:18:55.000Z","2026-11-10T23:39:32.654Z",[171,172,92,173],41,{"_107":184,"_109":185,"_111":186,"_113":187,"_115":188,"_117":86,"_118":-5},"Microsoft Research","MSFTResearch","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1603123064140890112%2FbSq-JVnp_bigger.png&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=cf3acddfa64c4c34","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1603123064140890112%2FbSq-JVnp_bigger.png&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=8c25c7eaa95b29cf 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1603123064140890112%2FbSq-JVnp_bigger.png&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=cf3acddfa64c4c34 96w",[189],{"_131":190,"_133":191,"_135":192,"_137":193,"_139":194,"_141":195,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"image","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzNFh5XQAAc3Eo.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=d3b61dab6b48d55c","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzNFh5XQAAc3Eo.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=29c15ac134914d83","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzNFh5XQAAc3Eo.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=5503fc93465ad13b 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzNFh5XQAAc3Eo.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=d3b61dab6b48d55c 720w",1400,788,"uditkv6u7rrzmtj1nx7pxbgjj","Claude Fable 5.2 实测观察：大模型正用代码吞噬审美与创作","作者实测 Claude Fable 5.2 与 Gemini 4 Carbon 并对比后认为，Fable 5.2 的突出差异在于审美，这是无法用 Benchmark 评估但可直观感受的东西。","作者以设计师出身的一手实测和社区案例，讨论大模型用代码承载审美、吞噬数字创作的趋势判断。",{"_95":206},"2026-11-10T23:56:00.000Z","2026-11-11T00:01:45.928Z",[90,91,205,94],71,"多模态","公众号：数字生命卡兹克",