友的 Agent 发起请求。",{"_95":368},"2026-11-11T00:08:03.000Z","2026-11-11T00:30:32.166Z",[119,92],66,{"_107":357,"_109":358,"_111":359,"_113":360,"_115":361,"_117":86,"_118":-5},"sameEvent",{"_66":355,"_68":356},"vouc5yc5intvgg7311kekkhsi","Cursor Projects 升级为多人协作模式","matt palmer","mattyp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2111918243460030464%2FaVMpxoAo_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=af43f7c274d3f3f3","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2111918243460030464%2FaVMpxoAo_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=487692511caa04f9 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2111918243460030464%2FaVMpxoAo_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=af43f7c274d3f3f3 96w",[362],{"_131":132,"_133":363,"_135":364,"_137":365,"_139":366,"_141":367,"_143":-5,"_144":363},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=59773474cf5188fb","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=f371f0863b10adbc","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=ad4a09ae86add6a0 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2120307501128364032%2Fimg%2Fei0vRT-uljWgRP8h.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=59773474cf5188fb 720w",3840,2160,"Matt Palmer","gdzcf3peltnvl291gs83f7cot","KORA Systems 发布原生 AI 操作系统 KORA OS，将率先适配高通骁龙 X2 Elite","KORA Systems 发布宣称首个\"自下而上\"专为 AI PC 设计的操作系统 KORA OS，基于 NixOS 构建，在系统底层融入智能体工作流、上下文记忆和本地 AI 推理。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T00:27:15.870Z","2026-11-11T00:49:28.364Z",[119,92,219,377],40,"推理","IT之家·人工智能","uzrjlisjtkb3dcbvar6x3cfnl","苹果子公司 Claris 测试 Harbor 应用：把 Mac 变成本地 AI 服务器","苹果全资子公司 Claris 正在测试 Harbor 应用，可将苹果芯片 Mac 变身本地 AI 服务器，单台即可运行，也能通过雷雳 5 接口连接多台 Mac 运行更大规模模型。该应用能自动检测雷雳 5 设备，支持浏览、下载开放权重模型，无需手动配置即可获得端侧 AI 能力。Harbor 仍处早期体验阶段，尚未向公众开放，此前曾现身 App Store 但页面已下架。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T00:25:48.767Z","2026-11-11T00:49:28.374Z",[119,219,387],46,"开源生态","rn6fdavm92v9f917jm1sfwdhf","谷歌更新 Android Bench 榜单：Kimi K3.1 Pro、DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 与 GPT-6.1 Terra 成绩揭晓","谷歌 Android Developers 首次公开 GPT-6.1 Terra、Kimi K3.1 Pro 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 在 Android Bench 的跑分。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T00:56:56.237Z","2026-11-11T01:09:20.597Z","ai-models",[396,91,93,397],"评测/基准","DeepSeek","m7ul4psbkb5zyp0t254fr986o","Anthropic 投资需求火热，承销商拟将 IPO 目标估值上调回 $1.5T 或更高","FT 报道，因投资者需求旺盛，Anthropic 承销商计划上调 IPO 定价，把目标估值拉回 $1.5T 或更高。周二文件设定 $70-$78 的发行区间，计入员工期权和受限股后对应 $1.26T-$1.41T 估值；若定价超出区间，募资将超过 $100B，其中 Google、Nvidia 和 Microsoft 将按 IPO 价格投资 $26B。","报道补充了定价区间、募资用途和三大科技公司的入股安排，可帮助读者理解这桩 IPO 的资金结构与定价逻辑。",{"_95":279},"2026-11-11T00:58:06.000Z","2026-11-11T01:14:24.726Z","industry",[419,94],85,{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_111":281,"_113":282,"_115":409,"_117":86,"_118":410},[413],{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_260":411,"_262":412},"Anthropic forges ahead with IPO roadshow\nThey will sell up to 825M shares at $70 to $78 each, a range that values it at as much as $1.4T.\n\nAt the top of that range the deal raises about $64.4B, and Anthropic itself takes roughly $62.5B from 801M new shares.\n\nExisting stockholders are selling only 23.6M shares, so almost all the cash funds the company instead of letting early investors exit.\n\nEarlier talk had pointed to as much as $2T, and the cut follows a tech selloff and midterm results showing voters souring on AI data centers.\n\nEven reduced, the price sits above the $1.25T private valuation OpenAI reached last week.\n\nShares are expected to start trading on Nasdaq under the ticker “ANT” as soon as Thursday or Friday next week.","Anthropic 推进 IPO 路演\n他们将以每股 70 至 78 美元的价格出售最多 8.25 亿股，该区间对公司的估值最高达 1.4 万亿美元。\n\n按该区间上限计算，此次交易募资约 644 亿美元，Anthropic 自身从 8.01 亿股新股中筹得约 625 亿美元。\n\n现有股东仅出售 2360 万股，因此几乎全部资金都流入公司，而非让早期投资者退出。\n\n早前传闻曾指向高达 2 万亿美元的估值，此次下调发生在科技股抛售以及中期选举结果显示选民对 AI 数据中心不满之后。\n\n即便下调，该价格仍高于 OpenAI 上周达到的 1.25 万亿美元私募估值。\n\n预计该股最早将于下周周四或周五在纳斯达克开始交易，股票代码为“ANT”。",{"_131":190,"_133":414,"_135":415,"_137":416,"_139":417,"_141":418,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=24fca0600b1e3d48","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=2c75f4a09eac86a1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=e971c397c28dc34c 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzjqZKa8AAIK-T.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=24fca0600b1e3d48 720w",761,1026,"行业动态","a73jtskj9qghshz9b0pskrce2","CoreWeave 三季度营收增 168% 至 $3.66B，净亏损扩大至 $7.09 亿","CoreWeave 三季度营收同比增长 168% 至 $3.66B，但净亏损扩大逾 6 倍至 $7.09 亿，净利息支出升至 $846M。资本开支后现金消耗 $7.5B，合同积压升至 $132.5B，2026 年营收指引上调至 $13B-$13.3B；公司持有约 $4.12B 现金对近 $47B 债务，过去一个月股价跌超 40%，财报后盘后涨约 6%。",{"_95":279},"2026-11-11T00:53:50.000Z","2026-11-11T01:14:24.733Z",[419],{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_111":281,"_113":282,"_115":428,"_117":86,"_118":-5},[429],{"_131":190,"_133":430,"_135":431,"_137":432,"_139":433,"_141":434,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=dcd3140f15806e08","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=34db2551683a9a57","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=4ca7bfe669c9cd13 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWziu7VbkAADZAx.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=dcd3140f15806e08 720w",1025,931,"e4kab2ku3cujtz0fczna6fq07","Seedream 5.5 上线 ComfyUI Partner Nodes","Seedream 5.5 现已通过 Partner Nodes 在 ComfyUI 中可用，这是一个支持文本生成和图像编辑的多模态模型。能力方向包括原生 RGBA 透明生成、多轮局部编辑（只改描述区域、其余画面保持不变）、可读文字的海报与信息图排版、更真实的肖像质感以及提示词控光。",{"_95":443},"2026-11-11T00:42:03.000Z","2026-11-11T01:23:20.670Z",[119,442],"图像生成","Comfy Blog","q4uvrlk5c8jhveka0pzngb0mw","Anthropic 向 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户发放一次免费全量额度重置","Anthropic 为所有 Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户提供一次免费全量重置，覆盖全部模型和限额，12月10日下午2:00（太平洋时间）前可随时使用。官方称此前修复的几个小问题曾多消耗额度，为补偿已用尽周限额的用户而发放，入口在 Settings > Usage 或 http://clau.de/reset。",{"_95":461},"2026-11-11T01:06:48.000Z","2026-11-11T01:30:22.669Z",[119,94],54,{"_107":453,"_109":454,"_111":455,"_113":456,"_115":457,"_117":86,"_118":458},"Ado","adocomplete","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=57846a058e5be3dd 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1 96w",[],{"_107":459,"_109":459,"_260":460,"_262":-5},"ClaudeDevs","We've given all Pro, Max, Ultra, and Team users one free full reset, across all models and limits. Use it anytime before December 10 at 2:00PM PT.\n\nWe recently fixed a few small issues that used more limits than intended, and the Fable resets didn't do much for those of you who'd already hit your weekly limits for all models. While these issues didn't affect everyone, we want to make up for the trouble.\n\nYou'll find it in Settings > Usage, or at http://clau.de/reset.","Ado Kukic","mrgpwu6mwuv4bxgvcgvpa4zll","PFN 小鼠尾静脉自动注射机器人 AUTiv 获第12届机器人大奖“日本机械工业联合会 会长奖”","Preferred Networks 设计开发的小鼠尾静脉自动注射系统 AUTiv 在第12届机器人大奖中获“日本机械工业联合会 会长奖”，评审认可其高精度给药、降低穿刺失误与实验者针刺事故风险。AUTiv 通过 4K 立体相机图像与深度学习识别尾静脉位置，可自动完成约 0.3mm 尾静脉穿刺与给药，国内已交付约 20 台并决定追加生产。",{"_95":471},"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","2026-11-11T01:30:22.824Z",[419,470],44,"具身智能","Preferred Networks：AI 研究与产品","dslz00n65ld89m3spp8r42f06","MiniCPM-OCR 接入 Hermes Agent","太棒了，Luis！🚀 很高兴看到 MiniCPM-OCR 集成进 Hermes Agent。感谢你构建并分享给社区！💙",{"_95":488},"2026-11-11T01:33:38.000Z","2026-11-11T01:43:23.038Z",[119,269],{"_107":480,"_109":480,"_111":481,"_113":482,"_115":483,"_117":86,"_118":484},"OpenBMB","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=0f090400f960fbf9 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b 96w",[],{"_107":485,"_109":486,"_260":487,"_262":-5},"Luis Poveda","povedaai","Introducing the MiniCPM-OCR plugin for Hermes Agent.\n\nThis is a problem I have experienced myself: LLMs by themselves are not always very good at OCR; sometimes I have needed another model specialized in it to solve complex document parsing.\n\nFor example, recently I have had difficulties understanding some physician recipes and other manuscripts.\n\nThis is where MiniCPM-OCR comes in. You can use the model and harness you already have to utilize a best-in-class OCR model by @OpenBMB.\n\n@Teknium @NousResearch \n\nCode: https://github.com/PovedaAqui/minicpm-ocr-hermes\nPR: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/150268","面壁智能 OpenBMB","ygrmt2d79ov5ppr361blm795b","简短提示词让小型开源模型 NLI 表现追平复杂方法","一篇论文发现，仅用带少量示例的简短直接提示词（In-Context Learning），小型开源 LLM 在自然语言推理（NLI）任务上就能追平更复杂的提示方法。",{"_95":279},"2026-11-11T01:39:00.000Z","2026-11-11T01:45:24.558Z",[171,377],{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_111":281,"_113":282,"_115":497,"_117":86,"_118":-5},[498],{"_131":190,"_133":499,"_135":500,"_137":501,"_139":502,"_141":503,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=7f69b59160ae6569","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=0fe5219c9c8f9813","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=a5d24b480aa08a8a 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzqptsbQAAWDhK.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=7f69b59160ae6569 720w",1596,1354,"n7ipl0zqvdowb2bei4eg44xsj","Khosla 押注 AI 为每位访客生成网页","Business Insider：Vinod Khosla 押注 AI 能让为每位访客单独构建网页变得足够便宜，而这一成本此前一直使网站保持静态。\n\nKhosla Ventures 联合领投了 Coframe 的 2500 万美元融资，用 AI 为每位访客生成页面来取代静态网站。",{"_95":279},"2026-11-11T01:24:56.000Z","2026-11-11T01:45:24.565Z",[419],48,{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_111":281,"_113":282,"_115":513,"_117":86,"_118":-5},[514],{"_131":190,"_133":515,"_135":516,"_137":517,"_139":518,"_141":519,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=2432cbab82ca5b1a","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=7cd1f0970308cdc2","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=a1e04e0674c9e3e5 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzpo5-aoAAnM3W.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=2432cbab82ca5b1a 720w",755,902,"n2oqfdjfmgfr55upx4whlv56v","微软正式发布 .NET 11：开发更省时，AI 工具更齐全","微软在 .NET Conf 2026 线上大会正式发布 .NET 11，围绕运行性能、开发效率与 AI 应用构建推出更新，覆盖网页、移动端和桌面开发。新版带来数百项运行时与基础库优化，开发工具包内置 MCP 服务器模板，配套 AI 库与智能体框架支持模型接入、工具调用和工作流编排。C# 15 新增联合类型，.NET MAUI 默认采用 CoreCLR 运行时；该版本提供两年支持。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T01:23:02.620Z","2026-11-11T01:49:20.061Z",[119,269,173],"hl9vucjaloy0llz9kuc9kmvx3","Anthropic 为 Claude Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户免费重置额度，并扩大 MCP Apps 支持","Anthropic 宣布为 Claude Pro、Max、Ultra 和 Team 用户提供一次覆盖所有模型和使用限制的免费完整额度重置，以弥补此前 Bug 导致的词元超额消耗，太平洋时间 12 月 10 日下午 2 点前可在 Settings > Usage 或 claude.de/reset 领取。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T01:51:02.380Z","2026-11-11T02:08:35.008Z",[119,269,94],"l2ubk650ecfqppij0h3498iv4","ACE Music v1 在 AA-Music-Vocal v1.1 榜单登顶，超过 Suno v6","ACE Studio 的 ACE Music v1 在 Artificial Analysis AA-Music-Vocal v1.1 榜单首秀即排第一，领先 Suno v6。",{"_95":542},"2026-11-11T02:06:26.000Z","2026-11-11T02:31:38.805Z",[396,553],{"_107":542,"_109":543,"_111":544,"_113":545,"_115":546,"_117":86,"_118":-5},"Artificial Analysis","ArtificialAnlys","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5fe737d3f11168a8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=c43b9006db45a2fc 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5fe737d3f11168a8 96w",[547],{"_131":132,"_133":548,"_135":549,"_137":550,"_139":551,"_141":552,"_143":-5,"_144":548},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Ftweet_video_thumb%2FHWzzGP8aIAA3aCX.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=c0c151bc72395ef1","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Ftweet_video_thumb%2FHWzzGP8aIAA3aCX.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=0f5e4749a71df132","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Ftweet_video_thumb%2FHWzzGP8aIAA3aCX.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=ccd2142900247eec 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Ftweet_video_thumb%2FHWzzGP8aIAA3aCX.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=c0c151bc72395ef1 720w",1620,1478,"语音","yzjhilf6f2s4exh150c4paypo","FT 报道称美国商务部搁置将 Megaspeed 列入出口黑名单","据 FT 报道，尽管国务院、财政部、能源部和五角大楼等 4 家机构因 Megaspeed 涉嫌向中国走私 Nvidia 芯片而推动将其列入出口黑名单，但主管列入工作的美国商务部已搁置新增名单 2 个月。配图显示该公司与被指同 Nvidia CEO 黄仁勋有染的中国间谍有关联，未上 entity list。",{"_95":279},"2026-11-11T02:40:09.000Z","2026-11-11T02:46:28.507Z",[419,569],{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_111":281,"_113":282,"_115":562,"_117":86,"_118":-5},[563],{"_131":190,"_133":564,"_135":565,"_137":566,"_139":567,"_141":568,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=177c5ca2ac1824a9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=5b9d2b1a88045bdf","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=b52dc7a2b04deac7 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzrjFSbMAAfbbf.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=177c5ca2ac1824a9 720w",787,1075,"政策/监管","paeuetl01de8gg5m0zp2fp66p","阿里官宣千问 Qwen4 即将发布，Qwen4-Max 预览版已上线","阿里巴巴官宣新一代千问大模型 Qwen4 即将发布，称知识理解更深入、世界感知更立体，Coding 与 Agentic 能力持续进阶。Qwen4-Max 预览版已首发上线阿里 Token Plan，限时最低 1 折可体验；千问办公、Qoder、千问 App、QwenStudio 等已接入新模型。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T02:10:29.663Z","2026-11-11T02:48:24.723Z",[577],"模型发布","qkzvg84jth5fx1k2yiqkkaxhr","SpaceX 与 SINGULUS 签约引进 HJT 太阳能电池产线，支持超 100GW 设备规模生产 Starmind 卫星","SpaceX 11 月 11 日宣布与德国太阳能设备制造商 SINGULUS 签署重大供应合同，引进异质结（HJT）太阳能电池整套生产线，为得州工厂加速制造 Starmind 太空 AI 计算卫星提供电池供应。",{"_95":378},"2026-11-11T02:53:33.477Z","2026-11-11T03:27:39.842Z",[419,270],"toajz2icztxxscbv2l1k3ascx","Qwen4 预览版上线千问APP，千问Go!会员可抢先体验","千问APP已同步接入Qwen4-Max预览版，用户通过千问Go!即可抢先体验。全新一代千问大模型Qwen4即将发布，知识理解、世界感知以及Coding与Agentic能力均有进阶。11月11日起千问Go!会员推出限时折扣，最低9.9元。",{"_95":593},"2026-11-11T03:40:19.000Z","2026-11-11T03:41:53.500Z",[119],47,"公众号：千问APP","znkg4gbpmzwsegyun87hej1lp","OCC 发布监管框架，可自主移动资金的银行 AI Agent 被列入最高风险层级","美国国家银行监管机构 OCC 发布评估银行 AI Agent 的监管框架，依据 Executive Order 14434 要求，用 \"Super Intelligence\"（SI）一词涵盖此前所称的人工智能。框架将可自主移动资金的支付 Agent 列入最高风险层级，与实时信贷决策和金融市场准入同档。",{"_95":279},"2026-11-11T03:20:32.000Z","2026-11-11T03:47:44.887Z",[569,92],61,{"_107":279,"_109":280,"_111":281,"_113":282,"_115":603,"_117":86,"_118":-5},[604],{"_131":190,"_133":605,"_135":606,"_137":607,"_139":608,"_141":609,"_143":-5,"_144":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=5dbd770b54dd501b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794614400&sig=7dfe944c4d75b8f9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794614400&sig=47cfe10007fb4af4 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWzs_ZlboAA0wzc.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794614400&sig=5dbd770b54dd501b 720w",1066,1411,"vrln9dterc8u3q8exet5pimqp","MiniMax H3 Image 图像模型在 Runware Day 0 上线","MiniMax 官方感谢 Runware 对 MiniMax H3 Image 的 Day 0 支持，该图像模型基于开源视频模型 H3 构建，定位广告创意、电商与规模化内容生产。官方称模型支持最多 16 张参考图输入，出图速度提升 2–3 倍；Runware 版本输出最高 20 MP，提供 1K/2K/4K 预设与 1:3 到 3:1 宽高比，H3 Image Highspeed 速度为 2 倍，图像输出 $3.80 每百万 token 起，两款模型 4K 输出 11 月 17 日前五折。",{"_95":628},"2026-11-11T03:43:19.000Z","2026-11-11T04:05:44.860Z",[577,442],60,{"_107":619,"_109":620,"_111":621,"_113":622,"_115":623,"_117":86,"_118":624},"MiniMax (official)","MiniMax_AI","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=88dd5bd9dc483876","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=14a8c0d27b515c98 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1875100548535574529%2FVxHk9HyU_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=88dd5bd9dc483876 96w",[],{"_107":625,"_109":626,"_260":627,"_262":-5},"Runware","runware","@MiniMax_AI H3 Image & H3 Image Highspeed are live on Runware on D0\n\nMiniMax built its new image model on H3, its popular open-weight video model, calling it the strongest open-weight image model released so far.\n\n- Edit with up to 16 reference images\n- Output up to 20 MP, with 1K, 2K and 4K presets or exact width and height\n- Aspect ratios from 1:3 to 3:1\n- H3 Image Highspeed runs at 2x the speed, for quick edits and fast iterations\n\nImage output from $3.80 per million tokens, with 50% off 4K outputs on both models through November 17","MiniMax","thu1nes9bh49ngumfxgvaa25f","MiniMax H3 Image 开放权重图像模型上线 fal，约 10 秒生成 4K 图像","MiniMax 宣布 H3 Image 图像模型在 fal 上线，官方称约 10 秒即可生成 4K 图像。模型能遵循复杂提示词、精确编辑，并支持游戏与 3D 资产生成，官方表示其速度足以支撑智能体和生产力工具。引用的 fal 介绍称其支持原生 4K 生成与编辑、多参考图组合及精确文本渲染。",{"_95":628},"2026-11-11T03:42:42.000Z","2026-11-11T04:05:44.869Z",[119,442],55,{"_107":619,"_109":620,"_111":621,"_113":622,"_115":638,"_117":86,"_118":639},[],{"_107":153,"_109":153,"_260":640,"_262":-5},"MiniMax H3 Image is now available on fal.\n\nThe latest open-weights image model from @MiniMax_AI delivers exceptional visual quality at lightning-fast speeds, with powerful generation and editing capabilities.\n\nGenerate and edit images in native 4K, combine multiple references, and render complex text with precision.","cj78tkkh6hnytvqy2ojn0tb34","Claude Fable 5.2 用代码吞噬审美，作者实测对比 Gemini 4 Carbon","作者实测 Claude Fable 5.2，认为其审美能力是 Benchmark 难以评估但明显超越同期上线的 Gemini 4 Carbon 的关键差异，并展示社区用其写 Python 控制 Blender 做动画、写代码作画的案例。其中一幅画作未用图像模型，纯代码模拟颜料引擎画了70万笔，作者据此判断大模型正借助代码吞嘝虚拟世界中原本被认为无法计算的美。",{"_95":654},"2026-11-11T04:03:33.000Z","2026-11-11T04:09:42.364Z",[90,91,205,94],{"_107":649,"_109":650,"_111":651,"_113":652,"_115":653,"_117":9,"_118":-5},"数字生命卡兹克","Khazix0918","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=dfb543046f73574a 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e 96w",[],"卡兹克","all","tag","q","tab","time",{"_661":662,"_663":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
